  "notes": "{齟齬|そご} is a formal term using rare kanji ({齟|そ} and {齬|ご}, both relating to teeth not meshing). It describes situations where things don't fit or agree as they should.\n\nCommon collocations:\n- {齟齬|そご}が{生|しょう}じる: a discrepancy arises\n- {齟齬|そご}をきたす: to cause a discrepancy\n- {意見|いけん}の{齟齬|そご}: difference of opinion\n\nRelated terms:\n- {食|く}い{違|ちが}い: discrepancy, mismatch\n- {不一致|ふいっち}: disagreement\n- {矛盾|むじゅん}: contradiction",
